### 1. Simulate KYC (SUCCESS)
POST http://localhost:8000/kyc-check/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passportUrl": "https://cdn.example.com/docs/passport-1234.jpg",
  "aadharUrl":   "https://cdn.example.com/docs/aadhar-5678.jpg",
  "scenario":    "SUCCESS"
}

